<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 30.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 30.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 30     June 27   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  275.220     273.000     247.020   11.42 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.330     309.700     306.830    0.81 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.685     157.905     158.970   -0.81 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.760	46.814	47.182   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  457.380     455.740     419.180    9.11 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.120     140.320     141.685   -1.10 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.158	16.134	16.185   -0.17 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  240.360     238.540     212.430   13.15 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.867	 1.868	 1.888   -1.11 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.563	 1.562	 1.581   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  188.460     189.415     183.135    2.91 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
